      "resilience_desc": "5 sections: what resilience is + isn't, sources of resilience, daily + weekly practices, mindset shifts, honest caveats. Cultivated through relationships + practice + meaning, not solo grit.",
      "roi_desc": "Pick a target career + your current credential + income → see time, tuition, opportunity cost, total investment, salary increase, years to payback. Includes a 20-year cost-vs-gain chart, an interpretation paragraph, and alternative lower-credential careers in the same cluster that may offer better ROI.",
      "rti_tiers_sld_identification_methods_5": "RTI tiers, SLD identification methods, 504 vs IEP, the 13 IDEA categories, how to read a psych report, parent rights, and an interactive SEM / confidence interval simulator.",
      "sample_broad_level_task": "🧠 Sample broad-level task: ",
      "sample_items_are_educational_represent": "⚠ Sample items are educational representations. NOT actual proprietary items. Real test items are protected by test publisher copyright + professional ethics.",
