      "octopus_problem_solving_extends_to_mec": "Octopus problem-solving extends to MECHANICAL puzzles — pushing, pulling, twisting. They'll explore new objects extensively before committing to a strategy. Tests show ~70% solve rate on novel mechanical tasks.",
