      "after_resistance_reaches_100_turn_anti": "After resistance reaches 100%, turn antibiotic OFF and Auto-Run. Watch resistance slowly decline if there's a \"fitness cost\" of being resistant — but in this model there isn't one, so resistance stays. (In real bacteria, fitness costs are sometimes present, sometimes not.)",
