      "hunt_again": "↻ Hunt Again",
      "hunt_camouflaged_prey_by_clicking_them": "Hunt camouflaged prey by clicking them on a textured background. Each round, the survivors reproduce — and the population evolves to be HARDER for you to spot. By generation 10, you're hunting something almost invisible. The most viscerally interactive way to feel evolution happening.",
      "hunt_complete": "Hunt complete",
