      "a_learning_sandbox_drag_these_hypothet": "A learning sandbox: drag these HYPOTHETICAL dials — trend strength, sample size, baseline, and a what-if AI level — to feel where evidence sits between insufficient and over-interpreted. It does not read your data and does not change your live AI ceiling. No score, no reveal.",
