      "scale_is_unrecognizable_billions_of_pi": "Scale is unrecognizable — billions of pieces of content per day vs hundreds of books per year. Speed of distribution is global + instant. Algorithmic suppression is invisible in ways print bans weren't. AI-generated content creates new questions (who is \"the author\" of an AI-generated text that gets banned?). Cross-border enforcement is harder + easier simultaneously.",
