      "snowy_owl_populations_may_decline_30_5": "Snowy owl populations may decline 30-50% from current ~28,000 birds, primarily from Arctic prey-base disruption.",
      "snowy_owls_depend_on_lemming_vole_cycl": "Snowy owls depend on lemming + vole cycles, which are flattening in some Arctic regions due to changing snowpack. Boom years become more variable + unpredictable.",
